I've created a patch that automatically logs important game events 
(getting artifacts, killing unique monsters, etc.).

For the impatient: http://www.losgibsons.us/john/nethack.html
(I'd post it directly to the newsgroup, but it's about 50K uncompressed; 
I'm not too familiar with patch posting etiquette but I thought that was 
a little large.)

I originally got the idea from DavyDuck's suggestion for an in game 
diary 
(http://groups.google.ca/groups?hl=en&lr=&ie=UTF-8&selm=NMpWc.51672%241V3.1372078%40twister2.libero.it) 
  and the subsequent followups. The event log does not support entering 
your own messages, because as many people said, nethack does not need a 
text editor.

Unfortunately this patch breaks savegame compatibility, however bones 
compatibility is unaffected.

Apply the patch as you would any other and then #define EVENTLOG in 
config.h to activate it.

This is my first large-scale patch and any feedback is welcome. In 
particular I'd like some help cleaning up the output, so if you have any 
info on formatting monster and object names by id then let me know.

John

